<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Devin AI Automation</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:#0a0a0a;
    color:white;
    line-height:1.6;
}

nav{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    padding:20px 10%;
    background:#111;
}

.logo{
    font-size:24px;
    font-weight:bold;
    color:#8b5cf6;
}

nav ul{
    display:flex;
    list-style:none;
    gap:25px;
}

nav a{
    color:white;
    text-decoration:none;
}

.btn{
    display:inline-block;
    background:#8b5cf6;
    color:white;
    padding:12px 24px;
    border-radius:8px;
    text-decoration:none;
}

.hero{
    min-height:80vh;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
}

.hero h1{
    font-size:4rem;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero span{
    color:#8b5cf6;
}

.hero p{
    max-width:700px;
    margin-bottom:30px;
    font-size:1.2rem;
}

.section{
    padding:80px 10%;
}

.section-title{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:50px;
    font-size:2.5rem;
}

.services{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
    gap:25px;
}

.card{
    background:#151515;
    padding:30px;
    border-radius:15px;
}

.card h3{
    color:#8b5cf6;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.contact{
    max-width:700px;
    margin:auto;
}

input,
textarea{
    width:100%;
    padding:15px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
    border:none;
    border-radius:8px;
    background:#1b1b1b;
    color:white;
}

textarea{
    height:150px;
}

button{
    width:100%;
    padding:15px;
    background:#8b5cf6;
    color:white;
    border:none;
    border-radius:8px;
}

footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:30px;
    background:#111;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<nav>
    <div class="logo">Devin AI Automation</div>

```
<ul>
    <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
    <li><a href="#portfolio">Demos</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
</ul>
```

</nav>

<section class="hero">
    <h1>We Automate. <span>You Grow.</span></h1>

```
<p>
    AI Chatbots, Lead Capture, Appointment Booking,
    and Workflow Automation that save businesses time
    and increase revenue.
</p>

<a href="#contact" class="btn">Book A Demo</a>
```

</section>

<section class="section" id="services">
    <h2 class="section-title">Services</h2>

```
<div class="services">

    <div class="card">
        <h3>AI Chatbots</h3>
        <p>24/7 customer support and lead qualification.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>Appointment Booking</h3>
        <p>Automated scheduling connected to calendars.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>Email Automation</h3>
        <p>Automated follow-ups and nurture sequences.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>Workflow Automation</h3>
        <p>Connect apps and eliminate repetitive tasks.</p>
    </div>

</div>
```

</section>

<section class="section" id="portfolio">
    <h2 class="section-title">Automation Demos</h2>

```
<div class="services">

    <div class="card">
        <h3>🦷 Dental Appointment Bot</h3>

        <p>
            AI chatbot that books dental appointments.
        </p>

        <br>

        <a href="dental-demo.html" class="btn">
            View Demo
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>🏠 Real Estate Lead Qualifier</h3>

        <p>
            AI assistant that qualifies buyer leads.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>🚗 Auto Repair Booking Assistant</h3>

        <p>
            AI chatbot that schedules vehicle services.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>📧 Lead Follow-Up Automation</h3>

        <p>
            Automated follow-up email system.
        </p>
    </div>

</div>
```

</section>

<section class="section" id="contact">
    <h2 class="section-title">Contact</h2>

```
<div class="contact">
    <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name">
    <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email">
    <textarea placeholder="Tell me about your project"></textarea>

    <button>Send Message</button>
</div>
```

</section>

<footer>
    © 2026 Devin AI Automation
</footer>

</body>
</html>
